 reserved and meek, being somewhat ignorant in the ways of the world. With a tendency to be swayed by the opinions of those around her, she is easily tricked. As her father is the president of a pharmaceutical supplies company, Nina is belongs to a wealthy and upper class family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translation of official website character profile."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c46807"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8f8fa6d7575c136261ca86a87c24580bafee9656d33460c222e63183e781246d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f28ea7679b26b3ad5ad364d127ad9c41c6be3fdd00792d98772c6c82ae47640a.webp","width":240,"height":240,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c47639","characterName":"伊澄 久臣","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c47639"},"originalCharacterName":"伊澄 久臣","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The managing director of the record label DYNAMIC CHORD. His slogan is \"tenacity\" and he's a skilled boss. Since his eyesight is extremely bad, Hisaomi always has his glasses on."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translation of official website character profile."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c47639"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1c253ab42728cc8af40f4b3fb88b3315b7acd91dab805b624b9a26f8e2c5ba4c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/99122e2c414397a869e3b1e2f8d927ae503c2c8aa8c6e637f47b4cd778add526.webp","width":240,"height":240,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西田 雅一","creatorId":"vn